Follow every rule in @AGENTS.md. They override your defaults.
The data contract in @contracts.md and @contracts.py is the source of truth for every
function signature, JSON format, class name, constant and formula. Never change them to make
code work: change the code to match them. If a request would break a rule or the contract,
stop and explain which rule, instead of doing it.
